      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "3.出西尔维村，前往玛塔塔平原（116.182）处调查木围栏，进入岩洞。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "◆玛塔塔平原地图：",
      "type": "media-caption",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "4.与渔夫（14.9）对话，交出【小物资袋】获得【村民的情报】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "◆已经完成本任务的玩家，此处无渔夫",
      "type": "completion-state",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "5.返回西尔维村旅馆2楼与联合小队副队长对话，交出【通行证】、【村民的情报】获得【调查证】。",
      "type": "combined-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "6.出西尔维村，前往玛塔塔平原（154.174）处调查木围栏，进入奇怪的洞穴。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "◆奇怪的洞穴为随机迷宫，约9层；魔物为LV.42~46液态史莱姆、食尸鬼、颚牙，建议水晶：纯地、地水",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "7.通过随机迷宫抵达奇怪的洞穴底部，与诡异的阴影对话进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "◆战斗信息（触发此战斗不会中断自动战斗）：",
      "type": "battle-mechanic",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "Lv.50诡异的阴影（1动），血量约10000，不抗昏睡；技能：攻击、防御、崩击、连击、乾坤一掷",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "Lv.45颚牙（1动）*4，血量约1000；技能：攻击、防御、战栗袭心、强力风刃魔法",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "◆若BOSS战被飞，则第7步重新进入奇怪的洞穴继续任务即可",
      "type": "retry-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "8.战斗胜利后与奇怪的水晶对话，交出【调查证】获得【水晶碎片】并传送至迷宫顶层，请步行返回西尔维村。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "◆若不慎回城，则请勿丢掉 【水晶碎片】 ，重新完成新村2，即【登陆北方冰原】任务，抵达西尔维村后丢弃联络信，即可继续完成后续步骤。",
      "type": "recovery-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "9.返回西尔维村旅馆2楼与联合小队副队长对话，交出【水晶碎片】获得【补给信】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "10.与补给官对话交出【补给信】，获得【生命回复药（200）】*2，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆完成本任务后，可利用法兰城里谢里雅堡启程之间2楼传送石传送至西尔维村，传送费850G",
      "type": "post-completion-access",
